    {
      "id": "UgxShvajP7fV4Y9Fgk94AaABAg",
      "author": "@JayRuks-b4d",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nbnIwyYsF5KGzS2pWd-Bbv2zgtWKXIXYtKtnh9Q669BzQAGM9gxLELfbqgp3aEheu7BQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Watching from Rwanda...Namibian by nationality.Lived in the UK for 8 years then made the big move to here in 2024!Best choice I've ever made...bought land a couple of months ago,up in a village on a hill overlooking Lake Muhazi.Have moved in on my land and the morning peace here is heavenly.He is right, I wake up to my neighbours far away Rooster and cows and birds...I feel so blessed being here.God has trully answered my prayers.The only downside is making friends...language barrier...most Rwanda's ONLY speaks Kinya and are not well travelled which makes making true friendship with same interest difficult...but I never wanna be anywhere else.Thank you Jesus and thanks for uploading.May you have a cow :-)",
      "likeCount": 7,
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T20:14:12Z",
      "replyCount": 1,
